{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# Catti Cattenheimer\n🐈 Classmate of Kris and Susie in Alphys's class; Jockington's girlfriend.","x":-190,"y":-105,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"4"},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**Jockington**\nHer boyfriend and best friend.","x":-130,"y":-640,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**Kris**\nOpenly resents her closeness with Susie, whom he considers a bad influence.","x":420,"y":-260,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**Napstablook**\nRan into Catti's family during a similar rescue in the past, also getting stuck in a tree together with them.","x":420,"y":220,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Catti_overworld.webp","x":-190,"y":-405,"width":183,"height":260},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Jockington_overworld.webp","x":-130,"y":-850,"width":147,"height":180},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Kris_overworld_static.png","x":420,"y":-470,"width":75,"height":146},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Napstablook.webp","x":420,"y":10,"width":83,"height":180},{"id":"s3","type":"text","x":-580,"y":-280,"width":260,"height":150,"color":"3","text":"**Susie**\nOpenly considers her \"the enemy\" and a bad influence — scolds Kris for hanging out with her even after the rest of the class starts normalizing that friendship."},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","x":-880,"y":-310,"width":190,"height":190,"file":"Sprites/Susie_overworld_eyes.png"},{"id":"s4","type":"text","x":320,"y":-280,"width":260,"height":150,"color":"3","text":"**Mr. Cattenheimer**\nHer father — the whole family gets stuck in a tree in Ch.4, the same kind of incident Napstablook also got stuck in, in the past. [[Sr. Cattenheimer]]"},{"id":"s4-img","type":"file","x":620,"y":-310,"width":190,"height":190,"file":"Sprites/Dad_Cat_overworld.webp"}],"edges":[{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s1","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s2","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e_center-img","fromNode":"center-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"center","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s0-img","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s1-img","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s2-img","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s3","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s3img","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s3","toSide":"left","color":"6"},{"id":"e_s4","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s4","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s4img","fromNode":"s4-img","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s4","toSide":"right","color":"6"},{"id":"cross_susie_kris","fromNode":"s3","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_cattenheimer_napstablook","fromNode":"s4","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"3"}]}